## Original Content
Chinese official calls for more APEC efforts to remove trade barriers

## Summary
A Chinese official has called for increased efforts from APEC to remove trade barriers. This aims to facilitate trade in the Asia-Pacific region and promote economic cooperation.

## Key Points
- The call is made by a Chinese official for action on trade barriers.
- APEC is being urged to enhance its efforts in this area.
- Removing trade barriers is intended to boost economic integration in the region.


